# r1115 phase 9, boot A1 (same boot, /reload after the zp9 probe fix): SQ-FDI-04 rerun and an isolating extra.
pace 1

## RELOAD | /reload for the zp9 probe fix
> reload
sleep 45
> zp9 nothing
waitlog \[zp9\] unknown subcommand nothing 120

## SQ-FDI-04 | (rerun, probe describe fixed) eat out of each lunchbox tier: the food is tasted in both books, the lunchbox is not; one queue entry per bite
> pbot spawn fd5 18 -60 1000 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> clear fd5
> zc4 sol fd5
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd5 20
> zc4 hunger fd5 2
> zp9 lbfill fd5 solapplepie:lunchbag minecraft:cooked_beef 2
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zp9 heldeat fd5
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zc4 sol fd5 minecraft:cooked_beef
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd5 20
> zc4 sol fd5 solapplepie:lunchbag
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd5 20
> zc4 hunger fd5 2
> zp9 lbfill fd5 solapplepie:lunchbox minecraft:baked_potato 2
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zp9 heldeat fd5
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zc4 sol fd5 minecraft:baked_potato
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd5 20
> zc4 sol fd5 solapplepie:lunchbox
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd5 20
> zc4 hunger fd5 2
> zp9 lbfill fd5 solapplepie:golden_lunchbox minecraft:cookie 2
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zp9 heldeat fd5
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zc4 sol fd5 minecraft:cookie
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd5 20
> zc4 sol fd5 solapplepie:golden_lunchbox
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd5 20
> zc4 hunger fd5 2
> zp9 lbfill fd5 creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox minecraft:pumpkin_pie 2
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zp9 heldeat fd5
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zc4 sol fd5 minecraft:pumpkin_pie
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd5 20
> zc4 sol fd5 creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd5 20
# a second bite of the same food: the queue grows by one, the tasted count does not
> zc4 hunger fd5 2
> zp9 heldeat fd5
waitlog \[zp9\] done 20
> zc4 sol fd5 minecraft:pumpkin_pie
waitlog \[zc4\] sol fd5 20
count \[zp9\] heldeat fd5 \S+lunch\S+ -> .* food= >= 5
count carrotHas=true applepieHas=true >= 4
reject \[zp9\] error|\[zc4\] .*error
look per box: the food line carrotHas=true applepieHas=true, the lunchbox line carrotHas=false applepieHas=false; carrot and applepie counts +1 per new food; applepieEntries +1 per bite (also the repeated pumpkin pie bite)


